{"term":"discrimination","senses":[{"id":"kaikki:895af4c6d06c6b2031","definition":"Discernment, the act of discriminating, discerning, distinguishing, noting or perceiving differences between things, with the intent to understand rightly and make correct decisions.","example":"Have you felt the weight of the considerations which have been presented, in order to show the importance of discrimination on the subject of revealed truth?","pos":"noun","synonyms":["differentiation"],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"usage":"","register":"countable, uncountable","wordFamily":["antidiscrimination","counterdiscrimination","enantiodiscrimination","facial discrimination","indiscrimination","non-discrimination","nondiscrimination","positive discrimination","price discrimination","reverse discrimination","self-discrimination","self discrimination","underdiscrimination"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/discrimination#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"},{"id":"kaikki:a5df0291766fa19a7e","definition":"Differential treatment of an individual or group to their disadvantage; treatment or consideration based on class or category rather than individual merit; partiality; prejudice; bigotry.","example":"sexual or racial discrimination","pos":"noun","synonyms":[],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"usage":"sometimes","register":"countable, sometimes, uncountable","wordFamily":["antidiscrimination","counterdiscrimination","enantiodiscrimination","facial discrimination","indiscrimination","non-discrimination","nondiscrimination","positive discrimination","price discrimination","reverse discrimination","self-discrimination","self discrimination","underdiscrimination"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/discrimination#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"},{"id":"kaikki:c3121c471a04035758","definiti